=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ SED @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt GNU sed @VERSION@ for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt GNU sed is free software under the GNU GPL, version 3 or later.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [SED.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for GNU sed
    At system startup: to define SED$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:SED$STARTUP.COM
    For each user: to define the sed command, add this line to LOGIN.COM:
    $ @SED$ROOT:[000000]SED$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE SED removes the product and deassigns SED$ROOT.
